.TH QSM-PVE-DIRECT-LXC 8 "2026-10-20" "QSM Direct" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qsm-pve-direct-lxc \- Provision a selected LXC graphical console
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsm-pve-direct-lxc {enable|disable|status} VMID [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run this helper on the Proxmox host. It installs the embedded matching guest package inside the selected container. The guest package must not be installed on the host. Review GPU and session provisioning in the installed documentation.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
See /usr/share/doc/qsm-pve-direct-lxc/README.Debian and
.UR https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd
the project repository
.UE .
